<view class="detail-page page-with-fixed-bar">
  <state-view
    status="{{loading ? 'loading' : error ? 'error' : 'idle'}}"
    error-text="{{error}}"
    bind:retry="onRetry"
  ></state-view>

  <block wx:if="{{profile}}">
    <view class="profile-head">
      <view class="profile-avatar">{{profile.avatarText}}</view>
      <view class="profile-copy">
        <view class="profile-name">
          <text>{{profile.displayName}}</text>
          <text class="verified" wx:if="{{profile.verified}}">已认证</text>
        </view>
        <view class="profile-meta">{{profile.yearLabel}} · {{profile.regionLabel}}</view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="detail-rows card">
      <view class="detail-row">
        <text class="detail-label">毕业院系</text>
        <text class="detail-value">{{profile.college}}</text>
      </view>
      <view class="detail-row">
        <text class="detail-label">所在行业</text>
        <text class="detail-value">{{profile.industryLabel}}</text>
      </view>
      <view class="detail-row">
        <text class="detail-label">专业方向</text>
        <text class="detail-value">{{profile.direction}}</text>
      </view>
      <view class="detail-row">
        <text class="detail-label">公开状态</text>
        <text class="detail-value">{{profile.privacyLabel}}</text>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="section">
      <view class="section-head"><text class="section-title">个人介绍</text></view>
      <view class="card">
        <view class="card-desc">{{profile.intro}}</view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="section">
      <view class="notice-box">
        你的联系方式不会在通讯录中公开。只有在双方建立联系、且双方都开启联系方式共享之后，彼此才能看到联系方式。
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="page-bottom-space"></view>
  </block>

  <view class="fixed-bar" wx:if="{{profile}}">
    <view class="btn-row">
      <button class="btn-ghost btn-block" bindtap="onPrivacyTap">隐私设置</button>
      <button class="btn-main btn-block" bindtap="onEditTap">编辑资料</button>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
